{"story":{"id":"event-distar-212","title":{"zh":"族母之死","en":"Death of the Matriarch"},"category":"exploration","kind":"event","image":"art/b241b8a49eb6fbd57687.webp","start":"distar.212","chapters":9,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们大获全胜的舰队在濒死的缇扬奇族母身旁游弋，她那闪闪发亮的肉身上布满了弹孔和伤痕。她那巨大的触须虽然仍试图捕捉附近的舰船，但动作逐渐放缓，最终停了下来。\n\n就这样，古老的族母被终结了，就像那些在我们之前企图围捕她的舰队一样。","en":"Our victorious fleet circles the dying Tiyanki Matriarch, her glowing flesh scored by countless blast-marks. The violent thrashing of her tentacles, still trying to grasp at nearby ships, first slows, then draws abruptly to an end.\n\nAt last she expires: the an"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"distar.212","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"击毁舰船时","en":"When a ship is destroyed"}]},"children":["n2","n3","n4","n5","n6","n7","n8","n9","n10"]},"n2":{"doc":"distar.213","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"distar.212.a","optionIndex":0,"group":"c5558","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"","value":true}]]],"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6648"},"children":["n11"]},"n3":{"doc":"galcom.110","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"distar.212.a","optionIndex":0,"group":"c5558","delay":[{"days":"60"}],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"","value":true}]]],"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6649"},"children":[]},"n4":{"ref":"n2","doc":"distar.213","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"UNDERSTOOD","optionIndex":1,"group":"c5559","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"","value":true}]]],"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6660"}},"n5":{"ref":"n3","doc":"galcom.110","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"UNDERSTOOD","optionIndex":1,"group":"c5559","delay":[{"days":"60"}],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"","value":true}]]],"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6661"}},"n6":{"doc":"special_projects:REANIMATE_TIYANKI_MATRIARCH","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"galactic_features.385.reanimated","optionIndex":2,"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6674"},"children":["n12"]},"n7":{"ref":"n2","doc":"distar.213","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"galactic_features.385.reanimated","optionIndex":2,"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6682"}},"n8":{"ref":"n3","doc":"galcom.110","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"galactic_features.385.reanimated","optionIndex":2,"delay":[{"days":"60"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6683"}},"n9":{"ref":"n2","doc":"distar.213","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"distar.212.b","optionIndex":3,"group":"c5560","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"","value":true}]]],"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6697"}},"n10":{"ref":"n3","doc":"galcom.110","parent":"n1","via":{"option":"distar.212.b","optionIndex":3,"group":"c5560","delay":[{"days":"60"}],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"","value":true}]]],"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6698"}},"n11":{"doc":"distar.214","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"BATTLESTATIONS","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6734"},"children":["n13"]},"n12":{"doc":"distar.218","parent":"n6","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt:1520"},"children":[]},"n13":{"doc":"distar.215","parent":"n11","via":{"option":"ONSCREEN","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6910"},"children":["n14","n15"]},"n14":{"doc":"distar.217","parent":"n13","via":{"option":"distar.215.dismiss","optionIndex":1,"group":"c5567","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"no","scope":"","value":false}]]],"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:7004"},"children":[]},"n15":{"doc":"distar.216","parent":"n13","via":{"option":"distar.215.dismiss","optionIndex":1,"group":"c5567","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"no","scope":"","value":true}]]],"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:7007"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"distar.212","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"族母之死","en":"Death of the Matriarch"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们大获全胜的舰队在濒死的缇扬奇族母身旁游弋，她那闪闪发亮的肉身上布满了弹孔和伤痕。她那巨大的触须虽然仍试图捕捉附近的舰船，但动作逐渐放缓，最终停了下来。\n\n就这样，古老的族母被终结了，就像那些在我们之前企图围捕她的舰队一样。","en":"Our victorious fleet circles the dying Tiyanki Matriarch, her glowing flesh scored by countless blast-marks. The violent thrashing of her tentacles, still trying to grasp at nearby ships, first slows, then draws abruptly to an end.\n\nAt last she expires: the ancient Matriarch laid to an end, like her would-be hunters before us."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b241b8a49eb6fbd57687.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.212.a","label":{"zh":"终于搞定了。","en":"At last."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"distar.213","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c5558","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"","value":true}]]],"source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6648","story":"event-distar-212"},{"target":"galcom.110","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c5558","delay":[{"days":"60"}],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"","value":true}]]],"source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6649","story":"event-distar-212"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_memorialist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"记念主义","en":"Memorialists"}}]]},{"key":"UNDERSTOOD","label":{"zh":"明白了。","en":"Understood."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"distar.213","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c5559","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"","value":true}]]],"source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6660","story":"event-distar-212"},{"target":"galcom.110","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c5559","delay":[{"days":"60"}],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"","value":true}]]],"source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6661","story":"event-distar-212"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_memorialist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"记念主义","en":"Memorialists"}}]]},{"key":"galactic_features.385.reanimated","label":{"zh":"派出[Owner.GetNecromancersUpper]。","en":"Send in the [Owner.GetNecromancersUpper]."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:REANIMATE_TIYANKI_MATRIARCH","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6674","story":"event-distar-212"},{"target":"distar.213","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6682","story":"event-distar-212"},{"target":"galcom.110","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","delay":[{"days":"60"}],"source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6683","story":"event-distar-212"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_reanimator","arg":"yes","scope":"","value":true}]]},{"key":"distar.212.b","label":{"zh":"从这头巨兽身上收集基因物质。","en":"Harvest genetic material from the beast."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"解锁用于星神兽转基因的多肢化特质。","en":"Unlocks the Polymelic trait for Leviathan Transgenesis."}],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"distar.213","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c5560","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"","value":true}]]],"source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6697","story":"event-distar-212"},{"target":"galcom.110","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c5560","delay":[{"days":"60"}],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"","value":true}]]],"source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6698","story":"event-distar-212"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"can_harvest_dna","arg":"yes","scope":"","value":true}]],"sets":["harvested_tiyanki_dna"]}],"next":[{"target":"situations:leviathan_celebration_opportunity","kind":"condition","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"condition","group":"c5561","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_robot_empire","arg":"no","scope":"","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"num_owned_planets","arg":"0","scope":"","value":true}]]],"source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6709","hooks":["after"],"story":"situation-leviathan-celebration-opportunity"}],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt","line":6600},"sets":["celebration_tiyanki_matriarch","standard_unity_reward","tiyanki_killed"]},{"id":"distar.213","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"族母之死","en":"Death of the Matriarch"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们还是把事情想的太简单了，上将报告说怪物的肚腹中有奇怪的东西在动。\n\n有什么东西要从怪物肚腹中钻出来了！","en":"...Or so it had seemed. Our fleet captains are reporting strange movement coming from the belly of the beast.\n\nSomething is about to emerge!"}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b241b8a49eb6fbd57687.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"BATTLESTATIONS","label":{"zh":"各战斗单位就位！","en":"Battlestations!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"distar.214","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6734","story":"event-distar-212"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt","line":6721}},{"id":"distar.214","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"破腹而出","en":"From the Belly of the Beast"},"texts":[{"zh":"一艘沾满了黏液、腐蚀严重的神秘舰船冲出了缇扬奇族母的肚腹，我们舰队做好交战准备，但那艘船突然关闭了武器系统和引擎系统。\n\n他们向我们发来联络！","en":"A mysterious vessel, covered in viscous fluids and damaged by digestive juices blasts its way out of the corpse of the fallen Tiyanki Matriarch. Our fleet stands at the ready, but the ship immediately powers down its weapons and engines after emerging.\n\nThey are hailing us!"}],"sections":[],"image":"art/4874e59c1c4f9ff9a395.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"ONSCREEN","label":{"zh":"显示在屏幕上。","en":"On screen."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"distar.215","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:6910","story":"event-distar-212"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt","line":6739},"sets":["is_in_recruit_window"]},{"id":"distar.215","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"瑞斯·昂多","en":"Reth Unddol"},"texts":[{"zh":"我是亚哈船长号的舰长瑞斯·昂多，我们被困在这怪物肚中已经很久了，几十年前我为了复仇而准备消灭这只怪物。\n\n结果报仇不成，我们的舰船反倒被这怪物给吞下去了，我还以为这辈子再也没机会看到宇宙群星了，多亏了你们帮忙。\n\n为了感谢你们拯救我们脱险，我们的舰船从现在开始向[Root.GetName]效忠。","en":"This is Captain Reth Unddol of the AH4B. Long have I suffered in the caustic bowels of that fell beast. Decades ago I came to hunt it, to repay a debt long overdue.\n\nAlas, I could not lay this baleful Matriarch to an end, and when she swallowed the AH4B whole, I was certain I would never again see the light of the stars. I am glad to see I was mistaken.\n\nFor putting my nightmare to rest, I would pledge my life and loyalty, and my ship, to the [Root.GetName]."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/3c986058dcd6900a1454.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.215.a","label":{"zh":"欢迎你们加入，舰长。","en":"Welcome aboard, Captain."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"allow":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"no","scope":"","value":false}]],"labels":[{"label":{"zh":"欢迎你们加入，舰长。","en":"Welcome aboard, Captain."},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_gestalt_consciousness","value":false,"label":{"zh":"格式塔意识","en":"Gestalt Consciousness"}}]]},{"label":{"zh":"我们将互相协调。","en":"We will coordinate."},"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_gestalt_consciousness","value":true,"label":{"zh":"格式塔意识","en":"Gestalt Consciousness"}}]]}]},{"key":"distar.215.dismiss","label":{"zh":"把他处理掉。","en":"Dispose of him."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"我们只要你们的船就够了。","en":"Just your ship will do."},{"zh":"你们是有机生物，因此必须被消灭掉。但你们的船我们可以留下。","en":"You are organic. You will be exterminated. Your ship, however..."},{"zh":"猎物。我们会实现缇扬奇未竟的遗志。","en":"Prey. We will succeed where the Tiyanki failed."},{"zh":"此人不过是把燃料。处理掉他。","en":"He is but fuel for the flames. Get rid of him."},{"zh":"[Root.GetName]绝不允许异星生物服侍自己，也不允许任何异星生物活着。","en":"The [Root.GetName] will suffer no xenos to serve. Or live."}],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"distar.217","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c5567","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"no","scope":"","value":false}]]],"source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:7004","story":"event-distar-212"},{"target":"distar.216","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","group":"c5567","when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"is_homicidal","arg":"no","scope":"","value":true}]]],"source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:7007","story":"event-distar-212"}],"terminal":false,"allow":[[{"type":"other","key":"values_others","arg":"no","scope":"","value":false}]]},{"key":"distar.215.d","label":{"zh":"你只狩猎缇扬奇吗？","en":"Do you only hunt Tiyanki?"},"responses":[{"zh":"那不是，我好多年来都在猎杀所有在星际航行的东西：变形虫、晶体、还有超出我们认知领域的噩梦般的东西，我全部干掉了！如果你想，我甚至可以猎杀最危险的猎物……","en":"Oh no, I've spent years bringing down anything that traverses the stars: Amoebas, Crystals, nightmarish entities beyond our realm of understanding - I have hunted it all! If you want, I can even hunt down the most dangerous prey..."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt","line":6915}},{"id":"distar.217","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"破腹而出","en":"From the Belly of the Beast"},"texts":[{"zh":"绝对不行。这艘船就是我的命根子……你们在干什么？你们不能把我塞进逃生舱！\n\n住手！我的话还没说完……！","en":"Out of the question. This ship has been my only lifeline for... what are you doing? You cannot just stuff me in an escape pod!\n\nStop! You haven't heard the last of me...!"}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.217.a","label":{"zh":"一路平安！","en":"Safe travels!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt","line":7108}},{"id":"distar.216","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"破腹而出","en":"From the Belly of the Beast"},"texts":[{"zh":"等等！不！你不能——不要碰我！\n\n啊啊啊啊！","en":"Wait! No! You cannot -- get away from me!\n\nHRGAAAAHHH!!"}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"TASTY","label":{"zh":"猎物……","en":"Prey..."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":true,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}}]]},{"key":"distar.216.a.exter","label":{"zh":"消灭掉！","en":"Exterminate!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_machine_terminator","value":true,"label":{"zh":"铁心灭绝者","en":"Determined Exterminator"}}]]},{"key":"distar.216.a.scorched","label":{"zh":"燃烧！","en":"Burn!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"is_genocidal_infernal","arg":"yes","scope":"","value":true}]]},{"key":"SCUM","label":{"zh":"外星渣滓。","en":"Xeno scum."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_fanatic_purifiers","value":true,"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt","line":7018}},{"id":"galcom.110","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"违反缇扬奇保护法","en":"Tiyanki Conservation Act Violation"},"texts":[{"zh":"星海共同体的官员收到了我们最近就缇扬奇族母取得胜利的消息。他们告诉我方，消灭这只野兽明显违反了缇扬奇保护法，就算缇扬奇族母是敌对生物也一样。\n\n[Root.GetName]将在接下来十年内被视为违反星系法。此外，我们收到了一份巨额的罚单，理由是我们消灭了“一种独特的，整个星系中再也见不到的缇扬奇生命形式”。","en":"Officials from the Galactic Community have received word of our recent victory against the Tiyanki Matriarch. They have informed us that our destruction of the beast was a clear violation of the Tiyanki Conservation Act, regardless of the Matriarch's hostile nature.\n\nThe [Root.GetName] will be considered in Breach of Galactic Law for the next ten years. Additionally, we have been issued with a hefty fine for our killing of \"a unique Tiyanki life form whose like the galaxy shall never see again.\""}],"sections":[],"image":"art/bbeb0b25427a11373bc7.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"galcom.110.a","label":{"zh":"它不得不被处理掉。","en":"It had to be put down."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophile","value":false,"label":{"zh":"亲外主义","en":"Xenophile"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}]]},{"key":"galcom.110.b","label":{"zh":"但是……是它攻击我们的啊！","en":"But... but it attacked us!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophile","value":true,"label":{"zh":"亲外主义","en":"Xenophile"}}]]},{"key":"galcom.110.c","label":{"zh":"这些野兽必须死。","en":"That beast had to die."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":true,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/galactic_community_events.txt","line":1161}},{"id":"special_projects:REANIMATE_TIYANKI_MATRIARCH","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"复活缇扬奇族母","en":"Reanimate the Tiyanki Matriarch"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们的[Owner.GetNecromancersLower]现在已经构想出了一项大胆的计划用于复活缇扬奇族母，这样她就能效力于我们，伴随在舰队旁一同战斗了。","en":"Our [Owner.GetNecromancersLower] have hatched an audacious plan to bring the Tiyanki Matriarch back from the dead, so she may serve us and fight alongside our fleets."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/22e6eaa4d7d1ea897b85.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"distar.218","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt:1520","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"event-distar-212"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt","line":1500}},{"id":"distar.218","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"逝者复生","en":"Rise Again"},"texts":[{"zh":"经过一段漫长的仪式，缇扬奇族母从彼岸归来，并为我们的事业而效力。","en":"After a lengthy ritual, the Tiyanki Matriarch has returned from beyond and now serves our cause."},{"zh":"复活缇扬奇族母格外困难。即便我们已经有控制她小型子嗣的丰富经验，但族母的再生能力反复地吞噬掉我们的虫草[root.GetNecromancersLower]。但最后，我们更胜一筹；死掉的组织永远也不可能比我们更具适应力。\n\n现在，我们控制了族母，她的巨型鞭毛已经为我们所用了。","en":"Reanimating the Tiyanki Matriarch was especially difficult. While we have gained plenty of experience seizing control of its smaller offspring, the Matriarch's regenerative capabilities proved to be a significant drain on our cordyceptic [root.GetNecromancersLower]. But in the end, we triumphed; no dead tissue could ever adapt faster than us.\n\nNow, having taken control of the Matriarch, we twitch the titanic flagella."},{"zh":"缇扬奇族母已重新启动并重目的化。该巨型生物将作为一个有机单元服务于我们。将其原生的族母协议停用后吧，该星神兽现在将为我们所控制。","en":"The Tiyanki Matriarch has been rebooted, and repurposed. This titanic creature will now serve us as an organic unit. With matriarchal protocols disengaged, this leviathan will now operate under our control."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/22e6eaa4d7d1ea897b85.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"it_hungers","label":{"zh":"它饿了。","en":"It hungers."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt","line":7135},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_hive_mind","value":false,"label":{"zh":"蜂巢思维","en":"Hive Mind"}},{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":false,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":1}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_hive_mind","value":true,"label":{"zh":"蜂巢思维","en":"Hive Mind"}},{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":false,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":2}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":true,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}]]}]}]}